    "created_at": "2017-01-25T21:04:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-25T21:04:53Z",
    "body": "Providing the raw descriptors in Chrome was blocked on some internal platform-specific details that have now been resolved so I'm ready to try specifying the new attributes. I think that providing a raw descriptor blob plus tagging the parsed descriptors with their offsets into it is the best option. I'm reluctant to do any partial parsing because it will inevitably be incompatible with something in the future.",
